Package: libfastrpc1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qualcomm FastRPC client library for the compute DSP
 Runs code on the Hexagon compute DSP (the NPU) through the kernel FastRPC
 driver: libcdsprpc and its default listener. The audio DSP stays with
 hexagonrpcd, so the DSP daemons and their udev rules are not included.
